WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:06.209
One of the oldest and most influential megacorporations
in the world of Cyberpunk is Arasaka.

00:00:06.209 --> 00:00:11.100
It has played a pivotal part in some of the
franchises most important stories and is set

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.910
to be a major player in Cyberpunk 2077.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:19.170
In many ways it's looking like Arasaka's role
in the game is set to be the culmination of

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:24.220
characters and plotlines the pen and paper
game has been building for decades.

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:29.070
So before we see it play out in the video
game, you need to know the history of Arasaka,

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:34.450
who its major players are, and how the simple
manufacturing company became a trojan horse

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:37.180
for world domination.

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:46.080
The now monolithic Arasaka started out as
a simple Japanese manufacturing company.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.149
It was founded around the turn of the twentieth
century by Sasai Arasaka, a clever businessman

00:00:51.149 --> 00:00:54.600
with a talent for predicting the direction
the world was going.

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:59.700
He saw World War 2 on the horizon and positioned
his company as a major military manufacturer

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:02.739
for Japan, bringing him a lot of success.

00:01:02.739 --> 00:01:08.320
Sasai also had the foresight to see that Japan
would lose, so Arasaka began distributing

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:13.780
its vast wealth to overseas accounts, sparing
itself from the ruin of the Japanese economy

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:15.720
following the country's surrender.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:20.470
In the years following the war, Arasaka would
slowly trickle those funds back in, keeping

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:23.640
the company on top as a vital part of Japan.

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:28.790
That’s how Arasaka got its start but the
history of the modern day Arasaka begins with

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:31.740
Sasai’s son, Saburo.

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:35.190
Saburo Arasaka was a renowned pilot during
WW2.

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:40.119
He was fiercely nationalistic, strongly believing
that Japan should take its rightful place

00:01:40.119 --> 00:01:41.750
as leader of the world.

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:47.540
Japan’s surrender at the end of World War
2 was a huge blow for Saburo, who contemplated suicide,

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:52.890
but like his father he had the vision
and foresight to think ahead.

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:58.000
Saburo saw the global economic path the world
was taking and knew that while Japan had failed

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.149
militarily, it could succeed commercially.

00:02:01.149 --> 00:02:06.189
Thanks to his father’s actions, Arasaka
continued to thrive and accrue a massive fortune

00:02:06.189 --> 00:02:07.540
after the war.

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:14.780
So Saubro prepared and waited until his Father’s
death in 1960 when he assumed control of Arasaka.

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:18.049
It was then time for Saubro to start his long
game.

00:02:18.049 --> 00:02:19.150
His end goal?

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:24.659
To bring back Japan to imperial glory and
become a political and economic superpower

00:02:24.659 --> 00:02:26.970
that controlled the world.

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:30.689
Saburo's first step was to create and expand
the Arasaka Bank.

00:02:30.689 --> 00:02:35.299
The bank acted as the reliable backbone of
the company, always providing good income

00:02:35.299 --> 00:02:38.760
thanks to smart business decisions on Saburo’s
end.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:43.760
This allowed Arasaka the freedom to invest
in other ventures such as the Arasaka Security

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:48.890
Division, which provided the highest standards
of electronic security as well as physical

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:51.169
manpower like armed guards.

00:02:51.169 --> 00:02:56.609
By the 1990’s Arasaka Security was the most
powerful and respected security company in

00:02:56.609 --> 00:03:01.019
the world, with thousands of businesses using
their services.

00:03:01.019 --> 00:03:03.209
And then the collapse happened.

00:03:03.209 --> 00:03:07.959
Ever the forward-thinker, Saubro saw the economic
crash coming and made preparations as well

00:03:07.959 --> 00:03:13.639
as a few manipulations in order to profit
from the destruction of modern society.

00:03:13.639 --> 00:03:17.859
Arasaka came out of the collapse as one of
the largest corporations in the world, and

00:03:17.859 --> 00:03:21.329
it was time for Saubro’s masterplan to take
shape.

00:03:21.329 --> 00:03:24.930
Arasaka Security would create one of the first
corporate armies.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:29.830
Saburo would go on a spree, buying out valuable
businesses with Arasaka Bank in one hand,

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:33.489
and eviscerating the competition with his
personal army with the other.

00:03:33.489 --> 00:03:38.959
By 2020 the mantle of CEO passed to Saburo’s
eldest son, Kei Arasaka.

00:03:38.959 --> 00:03:43.599
But in many ways Kei was just a figurehead
and the true power and decision making still

00:03:43.599 --> 00:03:46.469
lay with the 101 year old Saburo.

00:03:46.469 --> 00:03:50.799
His mind was still as sharp as ever and his
goal of complete world domination was ever

00:03:50.799 --> 00:03:51.799
present.

00:03:51.799 --> 00:03:55.729
The only thing keeping him from achieving
it was alliances made by other corporations

00:03:55.729 --> 00:03:58.610
in the interest of keeping Arasaka in check.

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:03.769
One such corporation was Militech, an American
arms manufacturer and military contractor.

00:04:03.769 --> 00:04:08.459
Militech was Arasaka’s biggest competitor
and this rivalry would end up being the source

00:04:08.459 --> 00:04:12.599
of Arasaka’s first major defeat.

00:04:12.599 --> 00:04:18.000
What would later be known as the Fourth Corporate
War started in 2021 as a simple rivalry between

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:22.960
two CINO and OTEC, which were fighting over
the assets of the recently bankrupt IHAG.

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:27.569
Looking to gain the upper hand, both turned
to the backing of large megacorps for military

00:04:27.569 --> 00:04:28.569
resources.

00:04:28.569 --> 00:04:31.979
OTEC went with Militech, and CINO went with
Arasaka.

00:04:31.979 --> 00:04:35.930
The two mega corps had been at each other's
throats for years and this was the perfect

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:40.629
excuse they had been looking for to begin
a proxy war where they could battle it out.

00:04:40.629 --> 00:04:45.039
And like many proxy wars it stopped being
about a dispute over a bankrupt company's

00:04:45.039 --> 00:04:46.090
assets.

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:51.620
In fact by 2022 CINO and OTEC had settled
their little war, but Arasaka and Militech

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:57.550
were just getting started and tensions quickly
escalated into a very real war.

00:04:57.550 --> 00:05:02.210
Many organizations and countries around the
globe were dragged into their conflict, including

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:07.409
the United States and Japan, both of whose
economies heavily relied on Militech and Arasaka

00:05:07.409 --> 00:05:08.740
respectively.

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:12.650
Things were spiraling out of control quickly
as this corporate rivalry was setting the

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:14.610
world on fire.

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:19.020
Eventually Arasaka began losing ground in
the United States with its final major hold

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:23.009
out being Night City, home of its American
headquarters.

00:05:23.009 --> 00:05:27.130
This all led to one of the most important
moments in the world of Cyberpunk.

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:32.240
Militech sent several strike teams of mercenaries
to infiltrate Arasaka Tower.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:35.000
One of which was led by the legendary Johnny
Silverhand.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:39.120
You can learn more about why Johnny was involved
in our video on him.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:43.680
There's a lot that happened in Araska Tower
that day, enough to do a whole video on it

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:51.300
alone, but the most important thing is how
it ended.

00:05:51.300 --> 00:06:01.110
A thermonuclear device was detonated, resulting
in the destruction of Central Night City and

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:05.949
the deaths of over half a million people in
what would be referred to as the Night City

00:06:05.949 --> 00:06:07.129
Holocaust.

00:06:07.129 --> 00:06:11.979
The blame was placed on Arasaka and US President
Elizabeth Kress used the event to nationalize

00:06:11.979 --> 00:06:15.630
Militech and expel Arasaka from the United
States.

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:20.560
Small conflicts continued for two more years
but at this point Arasaka had lost.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:27.819
CEO Kei Arasaka, eldest son of Saburo, committed
suicide in 2025, offically bringing the Forth

00:06:27.819 --> 00:06:31.879
Corporate War to an end.

00:06:31.879 --> 00:06:35.270
The fallout of the war severely damaged Arasaka.

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:39.539
All its overseas assets had been seized by
different governments, and it was kicked out

00:06:39.539 --> 00:06:40.910
of pretty much everywhere.

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:46.289
The Japanese government, which had long butted
heads with Arasaka, was terrified of a potential

00:06:46.289 --> 00:06:50.639
retaliation from other nations, despite not
being directly involved.

00:06:50.639 --> 00:06:55.699
But the government still needed Arasaka due
to its massive influence on the Japanese economy.

00:06:55.699 --> 00:07:02.090
So the government nationalized all of Arasaka’s
assets and Arasaka became a Japan-only company

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:03.720
for the next decade.

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:08.780
With the loss of its CEO and power, an internal
power struggle took place within Arasaka.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:11.159
There are three major players.

00:07:11.159 --> 00:07:16.689
The first was the Kiji, led by Hanako Arasaka,
the youngest daughter of Saburo.

00:07:16.689 --> 00:07:21.199
Hanako is an intelligent and kind hearted
woman who wanted to live an independent life

00:07:21.199 --> 00:07:26.469
rather than be a pawn in her father's corporate
game, which is perhaps why she led a faction

00:07:26.469 --> 00:07:28.819
to grab the power for herself.

00:07:28.819 --> 00:07:32.870
Next there’s the Hato faction, led by Michiko
Arasaka, the youngest daughter of the late

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:33.870
Kei.

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:37.970
She is a US citizen and had the backing of
the US Government, which wanted to take control

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.350
of Arasaka.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:44.870
The final group is the outside rebel faction
Taka, led by Yorinobu Arasaka, another of

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:45.969
Soburo’s children.

00:07:45.969 --> 00:07:49.319
Yorinobu is by far the most interesting of
the three.

00:07:49.319 --> 00:07:53.900
When his father told him of the true purpose
of the Arasaka Corporation, Yorinobu left

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:55.900
his family in disgust.

00:07:55.900 --> 00:08:00.840
He went on to become a famous Rockerboy, the
Johnny Silverhand of Japan; moreso in the

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:04.319
rebellious spirit as he was not an actual
musician.

00:08:04.319 --> 00:08:08.020
He started the Steel Dragons (Kotetsu no Ryu),
a gang he used to attack Arasaka from the

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:09.090
shadows.

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:14.430
Yorinobu was even involved in the events leading
up to the Nuclear detonation of Arasaka Tower.

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:18.219
Unfortunately there’s not much information
on the details of this decade long family

00:08:18.219 --> 00:08:19.219
rivalry.

00:08:19.219 --> 00:08:24.830
However, the conflict was eventually solved
and Arasaka reunited under one banner again.

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:29.090
Arasaka spent much of the next several decades
rebuilding power and regaining a foothold

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:30.380
outside of Japan.

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:35.919
A return to America was tricky following its
expulsion in 2023, but an opportunity presented

00:08:35.919 --> 00:08:38.969
itself for Arasaka to worm its way back in.

00:08:38.969 --> 00:08:44.600
The New United States had what was known as
the Unification War in 2069, an attempt by

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:49.630
the government to regain control of a series
of free states that had seceded from the nation.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:54.380
Night City had long been warry of the US after
it basically abandoned the city following

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:55.880
the Night City Holocaust.

00:08:55.880 --> 00:09:00.600
The City avoided involvement in the war until
the federal invasion of Coronado Bay gave

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.560
them no choice but to act.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:06.040
City Councilman Lucius Rhyne turned to Arasaka
for help.

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:11.440
This was the opportunity Arasaka was looking
for and it showed up days later with a supercarrier

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:14.630
causing a swift retreat of the NUSA.

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:19.089
The sudden involvement of Arasaka drummed
up fears of another 4th Corporate War level

00:09:19.089 --> 00:09:24.810
crisis, and as such the New United States
backed down and signed a treaty of unification,

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:26.230
ending the short lived war.

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:31.850
Night City was now an independent city-state
and by the present day of 2077, Arasaka was

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:34.209
once again in control of the city.

00:09:34.209 --> 00:09:39.790
Which brings us to the upcoming game in which
Arasaka plays a pretty major role.

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:44.290
If you pick the Corpo Life Path option, main
character V will start as an employee for

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:49.199
Arasaka's counterintelligence division and
you’ll get to see the ruthless Arasaka corporate

00:09:49.199 --> 00:09:50.870
lifestyle for yourself.

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:55.330
The company is also involved in the game’s
main plot, which involves stealing an ancient

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:57.820
prototype chip from Arasaka.

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:03.290
Expect an appearance from Saburo Arasaka himself,
who is still CEO of the company at the ripe

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.830
old age of 158.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:08.100
How can he possibly still be alive you ask?

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:13.589
We’ll let's just say Saburo had plans long
ago to download his personality into an AI

00:10:13.589 --> 00:10:14.800
when he died.

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:19.070
The very existence of this piece of tech has
been at the heart of many of Cyberpunk’s

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:22.920
most important stories and will be an important
part of the game.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:25.779
Yorinobu will also play a role in the story.

00:10:25.779 --> 00:10:30.350
He has, for unknown reasons, returned to the
fold of his father’s empire.

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:33.899
But knowing him, he has his own plans and
motivations.

00:10:33.899 --> 00:10:38.790
The events of Cyberpunk 2077 might end up
being another major chapter in the history

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:40.149
of Arasaka.

00:10:40.149 --> 00:10:44.980
We covered a lot of information today and
there are plenty of details left for further

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:45.980
exploration.

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:49.810
In fact, next week Jake will be diving deeper
into the Fourth Corporate War so make sure

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:51.140
to come back for that.

00:10:51.140 --> 00:10:54.750
As always let us know if there’s a particular
subject in the world of Cyberpunk you want

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.440
to know more about, and thanks for watching.

